{
  "title": "WasteManagement — Fleet Operations (Fleet-at-Scale)",
  "description": "[dd-demo-toolkit:waste_management] Fleet-at-scale demo. Every collection truck is a synthetic Datadog host (wm.truck.* + system.* tagged host:wm-truck-NNNN) emitted by docker/waste_management. The Host Map below shows the whole fleet as infrastructure — grouped by metro, coloured by engine temperature — alongside the live Leaflet fleet map served at http://localhost:8088.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "tags": [],
  "template_variables": [
    {"name": "metro", "prefix": "metro", "available_values": [], "default": "*"},
    {"name": "region", "prefix": "region", "available_values": [], "default": "*"}
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## 🛻 WasteManagement — Fleet at Scale\nEvery truck below is a **Datadog host**, created by the fleet simulator (no cloud instances). Host Map = the fleet as infrastructure; the live GPS map with moving trucks is the Leaflet showpiece at **http://localhost:8088**.",
        "background_color": "green",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "center",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 12, "height": 1}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Fleet size (hosts reporting)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "queries": [
              {"name": "q", "data_source": "metrics", "query": "avg:wm.truck.load_pct{$metro,$region} by {host}", "aggregator": "last"}
            ],
            "formulas": [{"formula": "count_not_null(q)"}]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 1, "width": 3, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Avg hopper load %",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "queries": [
              {"name": "q", "data_source": "metrics", "query": "avg:wm.truck.load_pct{$metro,$region}", "aggregator": "avg"}
            ],
            "formulas": [{"formula": "q"}]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "custom_unit": "%",
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {"x": 3, "y": 1, "width": 3, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Hottest engine (°F)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "queries": [
              {"name": "q", "data_source": "metrics", "query": "max:wm.truck.engine_temp_f{$metro,$region}", "aggregator": "max"}
            ],
            "formulas": [{"formula": "q"}],
            "conditional_formats": [
              {"comparator": ">=", "value": 226, "palette": "white_on_red"},
              {"comparator": ">=", "value": 220, "palette": "white_on_yellow"},
              {"comparator": "<", "value": 220, "palette": "white_on_green"}
            ]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "custom_unit": "°F",
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {"x": 6, "y": 1, "width": 3, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Lowest fuel %",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "queries": [
              {"name": "q", "data_source": "metrics", "query": "min:wm.truck.fuel_pct{$metro,$region}", "aggregator": "min"}
            ],
            "formulas": [{"formula": "q"}],
            "conditional_formats": [
              {"comparator": "<=", "value": 15, "palette": "white_on_red"},
              {"comparator": "<=", "value": 30, "palette": "white_on_yellow"},
              {"comparator": ">", "value": 30, "palette": "white_on_green"}
            ]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "custom_unit": "%",
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {"x": 9, "y": 1, "width": 3, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "hostmap",
        "title": "Fleet — every truck is a host (grouped by metro, coloured by engine temp)",
        "requests": {
          "fill": {"q": "avg:wm.truck.engine_temp_f{$metro,$region} by {host}"}
        },
        "node_type": "host",
        "no_metric_hosts": false,
        "no_group_hosts": false,
        "group": ["metro"],
        "scope": ["service:wm-fleet"],
        "style": {
          "palette": "green_to_yellow_to_red",
          "palette_flip": false,
          "fill_min": "185",
          "fill_max": "228"
        }
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 3, "width": 8, "height": 5}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "toplist",
        "title": "Hottest trucks (engine °F)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "queries": [
              {"name": "q", "data_source": "metrics", "query": "avg:wm.truck.engine_temp_f{$metro,$region} by {host}", "aggregator": "avg"}
            ],
            "formulas": [{"formula": "q", "limit": {"count": 10, "order": "desc"}}]
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 8, "y": 3, "width": 4, "height": 5}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Avg engine temp by metro",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {"name": "q", "data_source": "metrics", "query": "avg:wm.truck.engine_temp_f{$metro,$region} by {metro}"}
            ],
            "formulas": [{"formula": "q"}],
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 8, "width": 6, "height": 3}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Avg hopper load & trucks collecting, by metro",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {"name": "q", "data_source": "metrics", "query": "avg:wm.truck.load_pct{$metro,$region} by {metro}"}
            ],
            "formulas": [{"formula": "q"}],
            "display_type": "area"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 6, "y": 8, "width": 6, "height": 3}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "### 🗺️ Live GPS fleet map — embedded\nThe custom Leaflet fleet map, running live inside Datadog via the iframe below. Requires an HTTPS URL reachable by your browser (see `WM_FLEET_MAP_URL` in docker/waste_management/README.md — free Cloudflare quick tunnel).",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "center",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 11, "width": 12, "height": 1}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "iframe",
        "url": "__WM_FLEET_MAP_URL__"
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 12, "width": 12, "height": 7}
    }
  ]
}
